[E]hum [F#m]sang hein
[F#m]Mere tere [A]dil ka,
[F#m]tay thha [B]ek din milna
[B]jaise bahar [E]aane par.
[F#]Tay phuul [B]ka khilna
[B]Oo [E]mere [F#m]jeevan saathii
[F#m]Tere Mere....
[F#m]Tere dukh [A]ab mere.
[F#m]Mere sukh [B]ab Tere.
[B]Tere yeh [E]do nainaa.
[F#]Chand aur [B]suraj mere.
[B]Oo [E]mere [F#m]jeevan saathii.
[F#m]Tere Mere....
[F#m]Lakh [A]manale duniya.
[F#m]saath na [B]ye chhutega.
[B]Aake mere [E]haatho mein.
[F#]hath na [B]ye chhutega
